<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Arterial Vascular started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Arterial Vascular started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth Inc said Thursday it initiated coverage of Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc with a buy rating and a 12-to-18-month price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- The company, which makes stents used to repair and strengthen arteries, is the leading marketer of stents in Europe in the face of substantial competition, Dain said.</p>
<p>-- Stents represented an $820 million market in 1996 and is expected to grow to $970 million in 1997, Dain said.</p>
<p>-- Dain set an earnings estimate of $0.68 a share for fiscal 1997, versus $0.71 in 1996, $0.80 for 1998 and $1.13 for 1999.</p>
<p>-- Arterial Vascular shares were up 3/4 late Thursday afternoon at 17-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
